 "text": "Good afternoon Douglas. Sunday 04 October, 14:15 UK.\n\n### Updated groups from games still to start\n**Oscar (Odds Analyst):** 23 of the 30 legs below have a live bookmaker price (41 of today's 67 picks priced in all); prices from the Sports Almanac's Odds tab: API-Football for football, ESPN for NFL and baseball, tennis and rugby on the model's fair price.\n\n**Jade (Accumulator Strategist):** Five tested picks per group, each with a short, a middle and (Balanced and Stretch) a longer price, no leg used twice. Chances are the tested hit rates at each pick's level. Steady lands most often; Stretch pays more. All groups are also on the [Odds tab](https://douglasbakeronline.github.io/footyalmanac/).\n\n**Steady** · combined odds 2.77 · all five land on tested rates 44% · 1 of 5 prices is an estimate\n\n| UK | Selection | Event | Odds | Tested chance |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 18:00 | Chicago Bears | Chicago Bears v New York Jets (NFL) | 1.54 | 80% |\n| 20:05 | Montpellier Herault | Montpellier Herault v Toulon (Top 14) | 1.25 est. | 88% |\n| 21:25 | Seattle Seahawks | Seattle Seahawks v Los Angeles Chargers (NFL) | 1.28 | 82% |\n| 23:00 | Puerto Rico | Puerto Rico v Cayman Islands (CONCACAF Nations League) | 1.06 | 84% |\n| 00:00 | Aruba | Aruba v Anguilla (CONCACAF Nations League) | 1.06 | 90% |\n\n**Balanced** · combined odds 4.10 · all five land on tested rates 35% · 2 of 5 prices are estimates\n\n| UK | Selection | Event | Odds | Tested chance |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 15:00 | Saracens | Saracens v Sale Sharks (Premiership) | 1.28 est. | 83% |\n| 16:00 | Lois Boisson | Lois Boisson v Leolia Jeanjean (Adana Open Final) | 1.44 est. | 76% |\n| 19:45 | Netherlands | Netherlands v Serbia (UEFA Nations League) | 1.14 | 83% |\n| 19:45 | Portugal | Portugal v Norway (UEFA Nations League) | 1.64 | 80% |\n| 21:05 | Minnesota Vikings | Minnesota Vikings v Miami Dolphins (NFL) | 1.19 | 82% |\n\n**Stretch** · combined odds 7.62 · all five land on tested rates 26%